{'symbol': 'HAS', 'date': '2022-04-13 08:00:00', 'title': 'HASBRO TO ACQUIRE D&D BEYOND FROM FANDOM', 'text': "PAWTUCKET, R.I.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--HASBRO, INC. (NASDAQ: HAS) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT IS ACQUIRING D&D BEYOND, THE LEADING DIGITAL TOOLSET AND GAME COMPANION FOR THE COMPANY'S GROUNDBREAKING FANTASY FRANCHISE, DUNGEONS & DRAGONS, FROM FANDOM. FANDOM, THE WORLD'S LARGEST FAN PLATFORM, HAS OWNED AND OPERATED D&D BEYOND SINCE 2019 AND HAS GROWN THE DIRECT-TO-CONSUMER BUSINESS TO BE THE LEADING ROLE-PLAYING GAME (RPG) DIGITAL TOOLSET ON THE MARKET WITH CLOSE TO 10 MILLION REGISTERED USER"}